@startuml
title L2-062 - Search locations by keyword and keep results current
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

actor "Library owner" as actor
box "Frontend - Loupe application / domain / api" #E0F2FE
participant "FindLocationPage / LocationSearchResults" as page
participant "LocationSearchService" as client
end box
box "Backend - Loupe API application" #D1FADF
participant "LocationSearchController" as controller
end box
box "Backend - Loupe Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
participant "FindLocationsQueryHandler" as handler
participant "RefreshLocationSearchDocumentCommandHandler" as refresh
end box
box "Backend - Loupe Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
database "Library store" as db
participant "Durable work runner" as worker
participant "LocalEmbeddingProvider / IVectorWriter adapters" as ext
end box
actor -> page : Keyword query with filters, or filters alone
page -> client : query?, mode=keyword, filters, cursor?, pageSize?
client -> controller : GET /api/locations/search
note over controller : API middleware authenticates; controller binds only
controller -> handler : MediatR dispatch FindLocationsQuery
handler -> handler : NFC normalize; split tokens; validate filters; scope cursor to owner, mode, filters, page size [L2-062]
handler -> db : LocationSearchStore: every token as case-insensitive substring of name, address lines, locality, region, postal code, country, setting, notes, brief, tags, report text; filters on report JSON; owner and deletion checks
db --> handler : Rows in creation-date desc then id order, count; report-less rows only through manual fields
handler --> controller : 200 LocationSearchPage; No scouting report labeled; a blank query returns every filtered location
controller --> client : Typed HTTP response / ProblemDetails
client --> page : Update state signals; No results offers edit query or Clear filters; service error is a separate retryable state
page --> actor : Saved / loaded state or retained-input error
note over db : A save, edit, tag change, image change, or report publish records the SearchDocument intent in the same transaction; the stale vector is excluded immediately
worker -> refresh : SearchIndexWorker dispatches RefreshLocationSearchDocumentCommand
refresh -> db : Load location, report, and SearchDocument; Processing report while a requested report is pending
refresh -> ext : Build document without address lines; embed with the generation model
ext --> refresh : Vector
refresh -> ext : Publish only if Revision, ImageSetRevision, and report operation still match
alt still current
ext --> refresh : Indexed within 60 s of the save or of the report's success; detail shows current
else changed, deleted, or failed
ext --> refresh : Discarded; Updating search remains, or Search indexing failed with Retry after a failed job
end
@enduml
